        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Kelly\n- People: Soyuz TMA-4 participant\n- Projects: Soyuz TMA-4 expedition\n- Organizations: International Space Station (ISS)\n- Roles: ISS commander\n- Concepts: records for most time in space\n\nFacts:\n- A participant in the Soyuz TMA-4 expedition held a record for the most time in space at 381.6 days.\n- Scott Kelly served as commander of the International Space Station (ISS) during Expeditions 26, 45, and 46.\n- Scott Kelly broke the Soyuz TMA-4 participant's record of 381.6 days in space.",
